#
# AROSTCP network service manifest.
#
# Lists the external service daemons the stack launches at startup and manages
# across a configuration reload (through netservices.library).  One per line:
#
#   <name>  <path>  [order]  [stopsignalbit]  [signal|restart|ignore]
#
#   order        - bring-up priority hint (higher starts earlier)
#   stopsignalbit - signal number to send on stop (12 = CTRL-C, the default)
#   reload policy - signal  : survive a reload, quiesce/resume via signals (default)
#                   restart : stop and relaunch across a reload
#                   ignore  : leave untouched across a reload
#
dhcp  SYS:System/Network/Services/dhcpd  50  12  signal
